Formal hypothesis `hyp.certified-region-membership`, version 1. The exact source family belongs to the selected option under a retained checked introduction. Required premises: Exact introducing context and slot, partition, replay, cut and coordinate-to-target equality proofs with their used source hypotheses. Standing: Hypothesis; every undischarged use remains conditional.

